# Cloudflare Pages Redirects - Clean Canonical Architecture

# 1. Homepage canonicalization
/index.html / 301

# 2. Blog canonicalization (redirect legacy .html to clean canonical URL)
/blog.html /blog 301
/blog/index.html /blog 301
/blog/:slug.html /blog/:slug 301
/blog/:slug/index.html /blog/:slug 301

# 3. Categories Hub canonicalization (redirect legacy .html & variations to /categories)
/categories.html /categories 301
/categories/index.html /categories 301
/category /categories 301
/categories/ /categories 301
/category/ /categories 301

# 4. Category Authority Hub canonicalization (redirect plural & .html to /category/:slug)
/categories/:slug /category/:slug 301
/categories/:slug.html /category/:slug 301
/category/:slug.html /category/:slug 301
/category/:slug/index.html /category/:slug 301

# 5. Static Pages canonicalization (redirect legacy .html to clean canonical URL)
/about.html /about 301
/about/index.html /about 301
/privacy.html /privacy 301
/privacy/index.html /privacy 301
/terms.html /terms 301
/terms/index.html /terms 301
/disclaimer.html /disclaimer 301
/disclaimer/index.html /disclaimer 301
/contact.html /contact 301
/contact/index.html /contact 301
/help.html /help 301
/help/index.html /help 301
/changelog.html /changelog 301
/changelog/index.html /changelog 301
/feedback.html /feedback 301
/feedback/index.html /feedback 301
/dashboard.html /dashboard 301
/dashboard/index.html /dashboard 301

# 6. Tool Pages canonicalization (redirect legacy .html to clean canonical URL)
/:slug.html /:slug 301
/:slug/index.html /:slug 301
